Applies to: `index.html`, `style.css`, `src/`, `tools/`, `tests.html`,
`smoke.html`, `preview.html`, and the documentation in `README.md` and `docs/`.

This includes the synthesised Eurodance sting in `src/sfx.js`, which is an
original composition written for this project.

